      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Our Journey:\n\n\"Carrom has always been about gathering around the board,
    dialing in the perfect flick, and chasing the Queen. We\u2019ve recreated that
    iconic experience with pin-point accuracy and true-to-life physics\u2014bringing
    authentic, regular Carrom to life .\"\n\nEnjoying the game?\nIf you\u2019re having
    fun, we\u2019d really appreciate your support!\n\nRate us on the Play Store\nYour
    feedback helps us reach more players and improve the experience.\n\r\r"
