  m_text: "Suggestions & Improvements\n\nWe\u2019re constantly refining the flick,
    the physics, and overall experience. \nIf you have ideas on how to make the game
    even better\u2014or if you've spotted a bug in the arena\u2014we want to hear
    from you.\n\nDrop us a line at visionxr.opc@gmail.com. \nYour feedback helps
    us shape the future of this new tabletop evolution, and we\u2019ll be happy to
    roll out updates based on your input!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
